# 4 Vulpeculae

id:world-4-vulpeculae a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Vulpeculae" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4629822fcae28> ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "One of the two stars the article names in the Coathanger, which is an asterism rather than a cluster — the shape is a line of sight and not a group. This map's cluster catalogue lists only physical systems, so the Coathanger is not in it, and the two stars bear that out: 4 Vulpeculae is at 256 ly and 5 Vulpeculae at 235, 20.6 ly apart in space while appearing side by side." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

